{"job_id":"F-96880e2d6873d7b17e85","family_id":"F-96880e2d6873d7b17e85","title":"국군심리전단령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002695-14155-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":7,"target_id":"eb9faa048064d4d5aac7a4182ed8a70bba0ea1d16900a98281f02db46f5c41a3","source_hash":"c13afe5f6aac94224e53f589a4e1fb53d47cb9f20e4791466f709aa20d57e211","text":"韩国武装部队心理战指挥部"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002695-14155-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":68,"target_id":"c00c492e16e60d3a53cf4f41eb6b132a9975eef93209717860fb0df2a54d5bd8","source_hash":"cb70c076ae3abdf39694964ac356cdd0f55c5fcb79f1062ef38cd4af291af977","text":"第一条（设立）为实施和支援心理战，在国防部长领导下设立武装部队心理战组（以下简称“心理战组”）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002695-14155-ko","scope":"BODY","start":68,"end":178,"target_id":"59d22d12eac9242c1b6d21dc7b1dea76cfbc91849656c5b5e7208b5501a0e2dc","source_hash":"21e3b3ef11121fdafbae41d42f9c8d146e8abde3a10b19f399f5a691f35f9f40","text":"第二条（职责）心理战小组的职责如下：\n1. 对敌方及假想敌进行心理战\n2. 在收复区、占领区和脆弱地区支持心理战和宣传\n3. 为战术作战部队制作宣传材料提供支持\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002695-14155-ko","scope":"BODY","start":178,"end":220,"target_id":"d3bb2584739a0283f42aa932283b48fd811ba0c6df17eca331ae25f7a086df07","source_hash":"cd1343e3ea1a16e26bd1cf05a3f91f9338db574300fda971aa648fe34379ca4b","text":"第三条（主任）①心理战部队应当任命一名主任。\n②指挥官应被任命为野战级军官。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002695-14155-ko","scope":"BODY","start":220,"end":295,"target_id":"1f1dfb791c1dbdc4d09abe6725056db6503bcc17487729b6cbbf450f86388d99","source_hash":"9121c894843e23f96be2f3dd5a3b1fd555ab196f33905e6583c70162daba0892","text":"第四条（指挥官的职责）指挥官根据参谋长联席会议主席的命令，监督心理战小组的运作，并指挥和监督隶属于心理战小组或分配给心理战小组的部队。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002695-14155-ko","scope":"BODY","start":295,"end":411,"target_id":"a9f1637426c8efcad1b77d9b2496cd96157d59c30eacf69caacceb2f4943550b","source_hash":"731c28c410396b285c3ae368f9a3fb61a950c5c1e53c165217209bbd986ed81a","text":"第五条（部门和单位的设立）\n①建立心理战小组所需的参谋部门和单位。\n② 第1款规定的参谋部门的设立和职责划分事宜，由参谋长联席会议主席决定；部队的设立、任务和组织事宜，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002695-14155-ko","scope":"BODY","start":411,"end":456,"target_id":"55422405656c531a686944de0fb35a191f4f0e31c9b381aabf46485637bf0b6d","source_hash":"a679bfd04d1f4b7e0a623da00ae458221fe88f84fa8dae7e540ac7e60d4d3552","text":"第六条（人员配额）分配到心理战组的军事人员和文职人员的配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002695-14155-ko","scope":"BODY","start":456,"end":505,"target_id":"cd85ace736c32a110c64218ee7861a00561efb0ea3e64a74f598520484675f99","source_hash":"0c93d0ae207c2b2848138437d5a1543d307c1354545bfd484f2263e470961fca","text":"补充规定 <第13117号，1990年9月29日>\n\n本法令自1990年10月1日起生效。"}]}